#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:5
#: 1cd979a463af4e209237fbc192dabd06 6f49c6431e574ef4bb6748db2e8c2692
#: 7683057001a442a7a54c6b91fff3257e e858cb2aa0ba49f6a9e7f4f85e791bdc
#: f245d0fa2b8b4a3cbb47730963478087
msgid "Parameter Lockdown"
msgstr "参数锁定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:7
#: 17a6a73df4d144c18c529b9c42a0e24a 58285827f1f649299a3b714c585f1347
#: 61b552d780a84747bdf4b4ea2b33913c 7aa58f1f2f90459dbcf9115fedcb18c7
#: e9b5401e5d44473fb4aef730d4e1fc68
msgid ""
"To avoid accidental changes to critical parameters, ArduPilot provides a "
"parameter lockdown feature using the `param-lockdown.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.lua>`__ Lua applet."
msgstr ""
"为避免关键参数被意外修改，ArduPilot 通过 `param-lockdown.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.lua>`__ Lua 小应用提供了参数锁定功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:9
#: 256fad4222d84b0587b7c2948ed9a221 3b9ececce1b848e2bd5f7c3c3bd792f1
#: c6983544e12143ccac889dbdf0c567bb cf9b6fc94e4f4366a33b4c172e464e3c
#: f68ec06a09d448108a44b0e4a4fa9583
msgid ""
"As with other Lua scripts this requires an autopilot with a fast CPU and "
"sufficient memory (e.g. STM32H7)."
msgstr "与其他 Lua 脚本一样，这需要具有高速 CPU 和足够内存的飞控（例如 STM32H7）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:11
#: 1a835da325ca4a22b89d165fe49da6d5 62cbba0d57744931b3f0442babb014b5
#: 6d2ac5c93d2441d8928682c3c6c61bb8 78337a5777df4c19886ddfb6b8c4e8f1
#: 926e41e272ea46249b6769cccf0a59f2
msgid ""
"Please note that this is not an iron clad security feature because some "
"ground stations (including Mission Planner) allow users to stop and start "
"scripts meaning the user could stop the script and then change parameter "
"values."
msgstr ""
"请注意，这并非牢不可破的安全功能，因为某些地面站（包括 Mission Planner）允许用户停止和启动脚本，这意味着用户可以先停止脚本再修改参数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:14
#: 2ee7c5a18200457bbb77c29a9ac43a4b 6cbb365c469844299cd96f6f012559ca
#: ade30907e76b433ab23d58812c9dcea6 d9f749523d4e4a0cadeee69582a7d48b
#: f532ffed63c24b4c93288da0966b07ae
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:16
#: 62196d39045448f39cfe65472bdaf21d aa64d7e7740346b5b7efb13523ea82e5
#: e16b683ce2684cda9f0ae912d4b03fa3 ec679e3433bd496ba659cf80d111eacf
#: f4ced63e3f50461fa68ca116d0bfad5d
msgid ""
"Details on the setup can be found in the `param-lockdown.md file "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.md>`__ but in short this involves:"
msgstr ""
"设置细节见 `param-lockdown.md 文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.md>`__，简而言之包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:18
#: 08dd7d3aadcf4ff7b36118f6b21fe4cc 12dd2e6de0784a8384aeba77b41af686
#: 41da3af6629d49a1aae1da981a0329d2 77bcc6f95d9948d39aed6e97fd233d74
#: 92deae41ebdb487c958b124125873a2c
msgid ""
"Follow the :ref:`Lua Script setup instructions <common-lua-scripts>` to set "
"up Lua scripting on the autopilot including setting :ref:`SCR_ENABLE "
"<SCR_ENABLE>` = 1"
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`Lua 脚本设置说明 <common-lua-scripts>` 在飞控上设置 Lua 脚本，包括设置 "
":ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:19
#: 2218a66ae259444b99b69997c2d357e0 4088d748bff049719a635073c6124ec8
#: 4e466a65f02a46ae82b180f4266bc5a1 80b4313865e240ce89b02ff7c302cf66
#: e1b3907b38f24f0390c52a1375047bd2
msgid ""
"Download `param-lockdown.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/refs/heads/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.lua>`__ from the ArduPilot repository"
msgstr ""
"从 ArduPilot 仓库下载 `param-lockdown.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/refs/heads/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.lua>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:20
#: 32cffab61f3449b2978be792f2f7dc5f 9561c988e6084224aeb7ddaf472b2d82
#: bb82f35fe85a4f11bdcbff3e9fa750b0 dc7f5c6f684043678b44e546ea1f2ed3
#: e605d80cc25e4aadada1033a61092da8
msgid ""
"Copy the script to the autopilot's SD card's /APM/scripts/ directory and "
"restart the autopilot"
msgstr "将脚本复制到飞控 SD 卡的 /APM/scripts/ 目录，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:21
#: 3625ea551c6b4e20aeadd3a85d580890 376d893fa40242448073e78b4ff43ea3
#: 4f18498a966e4fee87146d99847dd12b 9208d7e359c9425da38c510706e03380
#: a81cb00d1fa74ec69e37933c433bfbb0
msgid ""
"Confirm the script has loaded by looking for \"param-lockdown script "
"loaded\" in the GCS's messages tab"
msgstr "在地面站的消息标签页中查找 \"param-lockdown script loaded\"，以确认脚本已加载"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:22
#: 3da7af409b19496da2983d6ee55cd3d0 8ec334edadad4c0da75adf7a69b53b6d
#: 97980f48ba7f4f1fa1ff8c62998430e2 ed558f4f90244a8c8636f152f42a5fec
#: f7829d537e95431d8cc6d0a1636cff6d
msgid ""
"Confirm parameters cannot be set by using the GCS's full parameter list to "
"change a single parameter value. If using Mission Planner it may be "
"necessary to reload parameters and then check if the parameter value has "
"actually changed or not"
msgstr ""
"通过地面站的完整参数列表尝试修改某个参数值，确认参数无法被设置。若使用 Mission "
"Planner，可能需要重新加载参数后再检查该参数值是否真的发生了变化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:25
#: 45b8a3900843405f907aeffe8017abe1 7d1dd6489f3d4391be38670dfc953683
#: 882ef0ce58744d14ae340d177a8b3521 b20da96c441c4acca9953a13d1e2a1ee
#: f3f731e35f3e4bd4bf31a357f11ecfa5
msgid "Customising the Script"
msgstr "自定义脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:27
#: 120c436be47441539a59abfeaf082517 4cebe78402604df89fc00a0ee80ba38e
#: 91d41d7d69104a808ba3d8e4563178ac 9dc364a98ffe4851b5189a5773bee76d
#: a43855473974429da034ed3a02c0be6a
msgid ""
"The list of parameters that may be changed is called the \"white list\" and "
"can be found `here in the param-lockdown script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.lua#L120>`__"
msgstr ""
"允许修改的参数列表称为\"白名单\"，可在 `param-lockdown 脚本的此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/param-"
"lockdown.lua#L120>`__ 找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:37
#: 416a5399fd13464d82bd0ff30b02e3be 72dd556de7164c079d7cc7ef847fa807
#: 7dcdfb43f3e242e48fb568aabf395154 c76ffbb31cfe475b961120b0c4011872
#: e1a893a91dd2471980803f6e9255dfbe
msgid ""
"This list can be customised by adding or removing lines from the list and "
"then re-uploading the script to the autopilot"
msgstr "可通过在列表中添加或删除行来自定义该列表，然后将脚本重新上传到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:40
#: 26e4f4dfae7e4d6a9057eb66b06a2a1c 3100bea657da422b9bb6d909947a8cb1
#: 3f924bffebc64e9bab3298751d55d7c2 4b57238c609a443088a37d8280d97535
#: cb48d7f58f8c4dc59d62751a505525cd
msgid "Alternative Method"
msgstr "替代方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-lockdown.rst:42
#: 156679e12e824abca84edf1004ae0d1c 44b0718e0d604db98c42e38edbc406ae
#: 4e99f3575baf471ba98f26122306d4b9 a7577beb67a145fc8d38f84c8a69015d
#: b92a21e812c84af299917c018c94d728
msgid ""
"Parameters can be marked as ``@READONLY`` in the defaults.parm file as "
"described in the :ref:`OEM Customisations <common-oem-customizations>` page."
msgstr ""
"参数可在 defaults.parm 文件中标记为 ``@READONLY``，具体说明见 :ref:`OEM 定制 <common-oem-"
"customizations>` 页面。"
